<span>Every 10 Heart Strikes, Rune Strikes, Death Coils, Soul Reapers, or Blood Boils will add one charge to your next Bone Shield.</span></td></tr>
<tr>
<td>4 Piece</td>
<td>
<span>Dancing Rune Weapon will reactivate all Frost and Unholy runes and convert them to Death runes.</span></td></tr>
